    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Crowley are delighted to offer a unique opportunity to buy an A rated fully finished new build home in the sought after Westport Quay area. \n\nThe three storey terraced houses have been built and finished to an exceptionally high standard and are presented in a turnkey condition. The A Energy Rating has been achieved with the installation of solar PV panels, air to water heating systems and triple glazed windows. Quality finishes include Aldana kitchens with painted timber doors, quartz countertops and splashbacks; porcelain tiling and well appointed shower rooms. Each house has a shed to the rear, a roof terrace and a Juliet balcony off the living room. \n\nThe floor areas measure approximately 114.6 sq m/1,234 sq ft to 120.4 sq m/1,296 sq ft. Ground floor accommodation comprises of entrance hall which opens into a small rear yard area with block shed; two double bedrooms and a large interconnecting Jack & Jill shower room. On the first floor there is a living room with side views to part of Westport Quay from a Juliet balcony, a very well appointed kitchen with adjoining pantry and double doors to a spacious roof terrace with feature stone walls. On the second floor there are two double bedrooms, the main with walk-in wardrobe and en-suite, and a shower room. \n\nLocation\nThe properties are exceptionally well located just 100 metres from Westport Quay where amenities include award winning restaurants and bars, shops, historic Westport House and grounds, primary school and The Point swimming spot. Westport town centre is 1.5 km from the property and can be accessed via the Westport Greenway walking/cycle path. A number of excellent Blue flag beaches are within a short drive along the Wild Atlantic Way. \n\nDirections\nFrom Westport take the Quay Road, pass the Westport Woods hotel, follow the road to the right after passing Centra supermarket for 100 metres and the properties are on the left hand side."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.81m x 1.73m & 3.37m x 1.08m & 2.87m x 1.41m\nPorcelain tiled floor, carpeted staircase, plant room, door to rear yard and shed\n\nBedroom One - 3.77m x 2.88m\nCarpeted\n\nJack & Jill Shower Room - 2.12m x 2.0m\nFully porcelain tiled, shower, sink unit, wc\n\nBedroom Two - 4.09mx 2.88m\nCarpeted\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 2.02m x 0.95m\nCarpeted\n\nLiving Room - 5.62m x 2.9m\nHerringbone oak effect SPC flooring, Juliet balcony with a glimpse of the sea\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.62m x 2.85m & 2.01m & 0.97m & 1.4m x 0.65m\nHerringbone oak effect SPC flooring, Aldana kitchen with taupe painted timber doors, quartz counter tops and splash backs with undermounted sink and routed drainer, integrated double oven, hob, dishwasher and fridge freezer, bin drawer, walk-in shelved pantry with automatic lights, double doors to roof terrace\n\nWC - 1.4m x 1.05m\nHerringbone oak effect SPC flooring, sink unit, wc\n\nSecond Floor Landing - 1.7m x 1.49m\nCarpeted, attic access\n\nBedroom Three - 3.7m x 2.9m\nCarpeted, glimpse of the sea\n\nSmall Walk-in Wardrobe - 1.2m x 0.9m\nCarpeted\n\nBedroom Four - 4.0m x 3.7m\nCarpeted\n\nWalk-in Wardrobe - 1.73m x 1.66m\nCarpeted\n\nEn-Suite - 2.16m x 1.7m\nFully tiled, shower, sink unit, wc\n\nShower Room - 1.67m x 1.64m\nFully tiled, shower, sink unit, wc\n\n"
      },
      {
